Design docs were *not* created in relation to this ticket. Work was completed in-tandem with [~accountid:70121:0c2bbad7-df14-43a2-a217-9d95c3099b75] and the engineering team. Please see John's demo video below for reference. 


*Error message: network-verifier has failed due to firewalls. User must take action by adding URLs to the firewall "allow list" in order to continue cluster creation. The network-verifier test must then be re-run in order to remove the alert and continue installation.*

*Taken from UX[part 1] design for ROSA/OSD netowrk-verifier:
{color:#c1c7d0}Background{color}*{color:#c1c7d0} *Info*{color}

{color:#c1c7d0}This story expands on or revisits the design work that was originally done in PD-1271, which involves how the network verifier validation runs in the OSD/ROSA wizard (on the VPC Settings step), it also covers how the varifier represents it's results in an in-flight (not pre-flight) check.{color}

 

[~accountid:999854:afb08692-85fd-48f1-9503-dd2a454438c8]{color:#c1c7d0} originally mentioned:{color}

{color:#c1c7d0}I've created some initial mockups for this in [https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1gO8eHfR_zNjVA-cq14LEyqZjEK0bbvORofTaqBrXiF4/edit]. Please review and help provide "official" mockups.{color}

{color:#c1c7d0}added charts with additional design info(Ref chart: 13 - 16):  [OSD/ROSA Network Verification improvements|https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1gO8eHfR_zNjVA-cq14LEyqZjEK0bbvORofTaqBrXiF4/edit#slide=id.g13203bc7b95_0_224]{color}

{color:#c1c7d0}*Goals*{color}
 * {color:#c1c7d0}Revisit the work that Will has created along with the original designs in PD-1271 to determine what is still accurate and relevant{color}
 ** {color:#c1c7d0}A meeting with {color}[~accountid:70121:e7c8b67e-27b6-4584-81d9-5330c43d647e]{color:#c1c7d0} and team may be needed to determine how the backend was implemented, which will influence the design{color}
 * {color:#c1c7d0}Capture the verification interactions in the VPC settings step of the OSD/ROSA wizard{color}
 * {color:#c1c7d0}Capture the ways that any errors are presented to the user via the in-flight check{color}

{color:#c1c7d0}{*}D{*}{*}efinition of Done{*} - targeted for [sprint/date]{color}
 * {color:#c1c7d0}Create a (new) design deliverable capturing Goal deliverables{color}
 * {color:#c1c7d0}Link design in this story{color}
 * {color:#c1c7d0}Review with all relevant stakeholders including {color}[~accountid:61f179dee218f0006af2886d]{color:#c1c7d0} {color}[~accountid:999854:afb08692-85fd-48f1-9503-dd2a454438c8]{color:#c1c7d0} {color}[~accountid:70121:362cd247-2a1c-4520-999c-f931f4cd5aec]{color:#c1c7d0} {color}[~accountid:557058:6246f31d-5d5e-4d8f-af15-69f189c5a751]{color:#c1c7d0} {color}[~accountid:712020:5341d590-79a7-4e02-98cd-db77a0916285]{color:#c1c7d0} {color}

{color:#c1c7d0}*Designs & Other Artifacts*{color}
 * {color:#c1c7d0}Design doc: [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1c8lmFx8h3DVvldA-iTBYnK8pClwDfn6i-kKJrJlqLuI/edit?usp=sharing]{color}
 * {color:#c1c7d0}Latest [Sketch designs|https://www.sketch.com/s/41744f51-d345-4149-adb6-e736fb13c36d/p/0033E225-7C11-420F-8548-E20E0E670FAB/canvas]{color}

